KPI tiles and charts on one surface, a natural-language query interface on the other, demand
forecasting with an inventory recommendation, and an explainability panel behind every number on
both. The dataset is 400 mock orders across one calendar year.

Unlike most of the work on this site, this one is open:
[github.com/mdhyaksa/spaceship-scout](https://github.com/mdhyaksa/spaceship-scout) ·
[live](https://spaceship-scout.m-dhyaksa.workers.dev/) (the shell loads for anyone; the API
is behind a login, so the dashboard itself needs credentials).

